#: content/en/posts/2024/krita-5-2-3-beta1.md:0
msgid "First Beta for Krita 5.2.3 Released"
msgstr "Unua Beta por Krita 5.2.3 Eldonita"

#: content/en/posts/2024/krita-5-2-3-beta1.md:8
msgid ""
"We are releasing the first Beta of Krita 5.2.3. This release primarily "
"brings a complete overhaul of our build system, making it so that our CI "
"system can now build for all 4 platforms (a Continuous Integration system "
"basically builds a program after every change, runs some tests and based on "
"that helps us track down mistakes we made when changing Krita's code)."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/krita-5-2-3-beta1.md:10
#: content/en/posts/2024/krita-5-2-3-released.md:11
msgid ""
"Beyond the rework of the build system, this release also has numerous fixes, "
"particularly with regards to animated transform masks, jpeg-xl support, "
"shortcut handling on Windows and painting assistants."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/krita-5-2-3-beta1.md:12
msgid ""
"In addition to the core team, special thanks goes out to to Freya Lupen, "
"Grum 999, Mathias Wein, Nabil Maghfur Usman, Alvin Wong, Deif Lou and "
"Rasyuqa A. H. for various fixes, as well as the first time contributors in "
"this release cycle (Each mentioned after their contribution)."
msgstr ""

