#: content/en/posts/2024/krita-5-2-3-released.md:0
msgid "Krita 5.2.3 Released!"
msgstr "Krita 5.2.3 Eldonita!"

#: content/en/posts/2024/krita-5-2-3-released.md:9
msgid ""
"Krita 5.2.3 is released after several weeks of testing of the [beta](/"
"posts/2024/krita-5-2-3-beta1). This is a bugfix release, that primarily "
"brings a complete overhaul of our build system, making it so that our CI "
"system can now build for all 4 platforms (a Continuous Integration system "
"basically builds a program after every change, runs some tests and based on "
"that helps us track down mistakes we made when changing Krita's code)."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/krita-5-2-3-released.md:13
msgid ""
"In addition to the core team, special thanks goes out to to Freya Lupen, "
"Grum 999, Mathias Wein, Nabil Maghfur Usman, Alvin Wong, Deif Lou, Maciej "
"Jesionowski and Rasyuqa A. H. for various fixes, as well as the first time "
"contributors in this release cycle (Each mentioned after their contribution)."
msgstr ""

