"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2133))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:102
msgid ""
"**Calligraphy Tool** - Fix \"Use tablet angle\" Calligraphy Tool ignoring "
"tilt. ([BUG:485709](https://bugs.kde.org/485709)) ([merge request, George "
"Gianacopoulos](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2121))"
msgstr ""
