"ignorante kliniĝon. ([BUG:485709](https://bugs.kde.org/485709)) ([kunfand-"
"peto, George Gianacopoulos](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2121))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:103
msgid ""
"**Grids** - Fix Grid visual glitches with Solid subdivision style. "
"([BUG:484889](https://bugs.kde.org/484889)) ([merge request, Grum 999]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2106))"
msgstr ""
