"Lupen](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2108))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-15.md:136
msgid ""
"**Recorder Docker** - Fix recording stopping when another document was "
"opened. ([merge request, Freya Lupen](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/merge_requests/2118))"
msgstr ""
"**Recorder Docker** - Ripari registradon ĉesi kiam alia dokumento estis "
"malfermita. ([kunfandpeto, Freya Lupen](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/merge_requests/2118))"

