"([kunfandpeto, Deif Lou](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2140))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-16.md:148
msgid ""
"**Scripting** Fix setting Color Adjustment (perchannel) and Cross-Channel "
"filters from Python scripts. ([merge request, Deif Lou](https://invent.kde."
"org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2134))"
msgstr ""
