#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-17.md:28
msgid ""
"@Deif_Lou has implemented a new feature which will help those who paint UV "
"maps. It is called propagate colours. As the name suggests it propagates "
"colours into nearby transparent areas which can be useful in the creation of "
"UV maps."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-17.md:30
msgid ""
"![Propogate Colors examples](images/posts/2024/"
"mu17_propagate_colors_examples-tomjk-deif_lou.png)"
