#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-17.md:32
msgid ""
"<figcaption>From left to right: the original image; the expanded image with "
"expanded alpha channel; the expanded image preserving the alpha channel "
"(note that it looks like the original one, although the color components "
"were propagated into the transparent areas); the third image after applying "
"a levels filter that makes the transparent areas semi-opaque to clearly see "
"how the colors were truly propagated. Images by @tomjk and @Deif_Lou.</"
"figcaption>\n"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-17.md:36
msgid ""
