"The team plans to make a 5.2.5 release in late September, containing various "
"bug-fixes from the past few months. These fixes include issues with no layer "
"being selected, bugs when triggering touch gestures and stylus actions at "
"the same time, broken support for Deflate-using TIFF files on Windows, "
"crashes importing audio on macOS, and many more."
