#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-18.md:153
msgid ""
"[Layer Stack] Fix no layer being activated on opening Krita directly into a "
"document, or opening a new view on a document, also when opening multiple "
"documents and switching between them. And prevent a crash when pasting into "
"a document with no layer active. ([BUG:490375](https://bugs.kde.org/490375), "
"[BUG:490843](https://bugs.kde.org/490843), [BUG:490636](https://bugs.kde."
"org/490636)) ([commit 1](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/238e0e55b5), [commit 2](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/3b58918168), [commit 3](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/0e0bcc3c61), Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-18.md:154
msgid ""
"[Layer Stack] Make sure that older files with simple transform masks load "
"fine and fix endless updates with clone layer + transform mask. ([BUG:492320]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/492320), [BUG:443766](https://bugs.kde.org/443766)) "
"([merge request, Dmitry Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2228))"
msgstr ""
"[Tavola stako] Certiĝu, ke pli malnovaj dosieroj kun simplaj transformmaskoj "
"bone ŝargas kaj riparu senfinajn ĝisdatigojn per klona tavolo + "
"transformmasko. ([BUG:492320](https://bugs.kde.org/492320), [BUG:443766]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/443766)) ([kunfandpeto, Dmitry Kazakov](https: //"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2228))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-18.md:155
msgid ""
"[Animation Audio] Fix a freeze when playing audio while scrubbing the "
"timeline. ([BUG:489146](https://bugs.kde.org/489146)) ([commit 1](https://"
"invent.kde.org/dkazakov/krita-deps-management/-/commit/c0c8a366d6), [commit "
"2](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/348aeb8679), Dmitry "
"Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"[Animacia Aŭdio] Riparu froston dum reproduktado de audio dum frotado de la "
"templinio. ([BUG:489146](https://bugs.kde.org/489146)) ([commit 1](https://"
"invent.kde.org/dkazakov/krita-deps-management/-/commit/c0c8a366d6) , [commit "
"2](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/348aeb8679), Dmitrij "
"Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-18.md:156
msgid ""
"[Input] Fix an input bug when triggering touch gestures and stylus at the "
"same time. ([merge request, Dmitry Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/merge_requests/2196))"
msgstr ""
"[Enigo] Riparu enig-cimon kiam ekigas tuŝajn gestojn kaj grifelon samtempe. "
"([kunfandpeto, Dmitry Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2196))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-18.md:157
msgid ""
"[Brush Engines] Fix a crash in the Filter Brush when changing the filter "
"type. ([BUG:478419](https://bugs.kde.org/478419)) ([commit, Dmitry Kazakov]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/1368f13860))"
msgstr ""
"[Brush Engines] Riparu paneon en la Filtrila Peniko kiam ŝanĝas la "
"filtripon. ([BUG:478419](https://bugs.kde.org/478419)) ([commit, Dmitry "
"Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/1368f13860))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-18.md:158
msgid ""
"[Animation] Fix black canvas appearing in animation when \"Limit cached "
"frame size\" is active and canvas filtering mode is Bilinear or Nearest "
"Neighbor. ([BUG:486417](https://bugs.kde.org/486417)) ([commit, Dmitry "
"Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/66e3b37f23))"
msgstr ""
"[Animiĝo] Riparu nigran kanvason aperantan en animacio kiam \"Limigi "
"kaŝmemorgrandon de kadro\" estas aktiva kaj kanvasa filtra reĝimo estas "
"Dulinia aŭ Plej Proksima Najbaro. ([BUG:486417](https://bugs.kde."
"org/486417)) ([commit, Dmitry Kazakov](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/commit/66e3b37f23))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-18.md:159
msgid ""
"[File Formats: WebP] Fix issue in WebP colorspace export when dithering is "
"enabled. ([BUG:491231](https://bugs.kde.org/491231)) ([merge request, "
"Rasyuqa A H](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2212))"
