"[Dosierformatoj: WebP] Ripari problemon en WebP-kolorspaca eksporto kiam "
"dithering estas ebligita. ([BUG:491231](https://bugs.kde.org/491231)) "
"([kunfandpeto, Rasyuqa A H](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2212))"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-18.md:160
msgid ""
"[File Formats: PSD] Don't let Show Guides prevent saving as PSD in a non-"
"default colorspace. ([BUG:492236](https://bugs.kde.org/492236)) ([commit, "
