#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:72
#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:65
#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-22.md:66
msgid "Stable branch (5.2.9-prealpha):"
msgstr "Stabila branĉo (5.2.9-prealpha):"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:73
msgid ""
"Layers: Fix infinite loop when a clone layer is connected to a group with "
"clones, and a filter mask triggers an out-of-bounds update. ([Change]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/d2022e8ba4), by Dmitry "
"Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Tavoloj: Riparu senfinan buklon kiam klona tavolo estas konektita al grupo "
"kun klonoj, kaj filtrila masko ekigas eksterliman ĝisdatigon. ([Ŝanĝo]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/d2022e8ba4), de Dmitry "
"Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:74
msgid ""
"General: Fix inability to save a document after saving while the image is "
"busy and then canceling the busy operation. ([bug report](https://bugs.kde."
"org/496018)) ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/23882dc7a6), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Ĝenerala: Riparu malkapablon konservi dokumenton post konservado dum la "
"bildo estas okupata kaj poste nuligi la okupatan operacion. ([raporto pri "
"eraro](https://bugs.kde.org/496018)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/commit/23882dc7a6), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:75
msgid ""
"Resources: Fix crash when re-importing a resource after modifying it. ([bug "
"report](https://bugs.kde.org/484796)) ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/commit/b18e25c5b9), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Rimedoj: Ripari paneon dum reimportado de rimedo post modifo de ĝi. "
"([raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde.org/484796)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent."
"kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/b18e25c5b9), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:76
msgid ""
"Brush Presets: Fix loading embedded resources from .kpp files. ([bug report]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/487866), [bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/456586), "
"[bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/456197)) ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/commit/072460560b), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Penikaj Antaŭagordoj: Ripari ŝargon de enigitaj rimedoj de .kpp-dosieroj. "
"([raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde.org/487866), [raporto pri eraro]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/456586), [raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde. "
"org/456197)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/072460560b), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:77
msgid ""
"Brush Tools: Fix the Dynamic Brush Tool to not use the Freehand Brush Tool's "
"smoothing settings which it doesn't properly support. ([bug report](https://"
"bugs.kde.org/493249)) ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2251), by Mathias Wein)([Change](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/commit/da166935de), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:78
msgid ""
"Recorder Docker: Prevent interruption of the Text Tool by disabling "
"recording while it is active. ([bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/495768)) "
"([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/be44e45a83), by "
"Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Recorder Docker: Malhelpu interrompon de la Teksta Ilo malŝaltante "
"registradon dum ĝi estas aktiva. ([erar-raporto](https://bugs.kde."
"org/495768)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/"
"be44e45a83), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:79
msgid ""
"File Formats: EXR: Possibly fix saving EXR files with extremely low alpha "
"values. ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/9d5e921077), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Dosieraj Formatoj: EXR: Eble ripari la konservadon de EXR-dosieroj kun "
"ekstreme malaltaj alfa-valoroj. ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/commit/9d5e921077), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:80
msgid ""
"File Formats: EXR: Try to keep color space profile when saving EXR of "
"incompatible type. ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2252), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Dosierformatoj: EXR: Provu konservi kolorspacan profilon dum konservado de "
"EXR de nekongrua tipo. ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2252), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:81
msgid ""
"File Formats: EXR: Fix bogus offset when saving EXR with moved layers. "
"([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/f8b4dce837), by "
"Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Dosieraj Formatoj: EXR: Ripari falsan deŝovon dum konservado de EXR kun "
"movitaj tavoloj. ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/"
"f8b4dce837), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:82
msgid ""
"File Formats: JPEG-XL: Fix potential lockup when loading multi-page images. "
"([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2263), by "
"Rasyuqa A H)"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:83
msgid ""
"Keyboard Shortcuts: Set the default shortcut for Zoom In to = instead of +. "
"([bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/484365)) ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/commit/3ca29b881f), by Halla Rempt)"
msgstr ""
"Klavaraj ŝparvojoj: Agordu la defaŭltan ŝparvojon por Zomi al = anstataŭ +. "
"([raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde.org/484365)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent."
"kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/3ca29b881f), de Halla Rempt)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:84
msgid ""
"Brush Editor: Make the Saturation and Value brush options' graph and graph "
"labels consistently agree on the range being -100% to 100% with 0% as "
"neutral. ([bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/487469)) ([Change](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/da166935de), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Peniko-Redaktilo: Faru la grafikaĵojn kaj grafikajn etikedojn de la saturado "
"kaj valoro-opcioj de peniko konstante konsentas pri la intervalo -100% ĝis "
"100% kun 0% kiel neŭtrala. ([raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde."
"org/487469)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/"
"da166935de), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:88
msgid ""
"Vector Layers: Fix endlessly slow rendering of vector layers with clipping "
"masks. ([bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/458407)) ([Change](https://invent."
"kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/d01ed5efaa), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Vektoraj Tavoloj: Riparu senfine malrapidan bildigon de vektoraj tavoloj per "
"tondaj maskoj. ([raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde.org/458407)) ([Ŝanĝo]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/d01ed5efaa), de Dmitry "
"Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:89
msgid ""
"Layers: Fix issue with transform masks on group layers not showing until "
"visibility change, and visibility change of passthrough groups with layer "
"styles causing artifacts. ([bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/491447)) "
"([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/75a084ca7e), by "
