"org/491447)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/75a084ca7e), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-20.md:90
msgid ""
"Brush Editor: Fix crash when clearing scratchpad while it's busy rendering a "
