#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:63
msgid ""
"Notable changes in Krita's development builds from Nov. 12 - Dec. 11, 2024."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:66
msgid ""
"General: Fix rounding errors in opacity conversion, which prevented layered "
"50% brushstrokes from adding up to 100%. ([bug report](https://bugs.kde."
"org/356462)) ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2268), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Ĝenerala: Riparu rondigajn erarojn en opakeckonverto, kiu malhelpis "
"tavoligitajn 50% penikstrekojn aldoni ĝis 100%. ([raporto pri eraro](https://"
"bugs.kde.org/356462)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2268), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:67
msgid ""
"General: Fix snapping to grid at the edge of the canvas. ([bug report]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/492434)) ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/commit/f639df17fe), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Ĝenerala: Ripari klakadon al krado ĉe la rando de la kanvaso. ([raporto pri "
"eraro](https://bugs.kde.org/492434)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/commit/f639df17fe), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:68
msgid ""
"General: Disable snapping to image center by default, as it can cause "
"confusion. ([bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/466718)) ([Change](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/5224bfa36e), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Ĝenerala: Malebligu klakadon al bildcentro defaŭlte, ĉar ĝi povas kaŭzi "
"konfuzon. ([raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde.org/466718)) ([Ŝanĝo]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/5224bfa36e), de Dmitry "
"Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:69
msgid ""
"Calligraphy Tool: Fix following existing shape in the Calligraphy Tool. "
"([bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/433288)) ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/commit/063b4d386a), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Kaligrafia Ilo: Riparu la sekvan ekzistantan formon en la Kaligrafia Ilo. "
"([raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde.org/433288)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent."
"kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/063b4d386a), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:70
msgid ""
"Layers: Fix \"Copy into new Layer\" to copy vector data when a vector shape "
"is active. ([bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/418317)) ([Change](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/75b20e7594), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Tavoloj: Riparu \"Kopii en novan Tavolon\" por kopii vektorajn datumojn kiam "
"vektora formo estas aktiva. ([raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde."
"org/418317)) ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"commit/75b20e7594), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:71
msgid ""
"Selections: Fix the vector selection mode to not create 0px selections, and "
"to select the canvas beforing subtracting if there is no existing selection. "
"([bug report](https://bugs.kde.org/445935), CC[bug report](https://bugs.kde."
"org/408369)) ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/"
"c3279cd2ae), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
