"([raporto pri eraro](https://bugs.kde.org/445935), CC[raporto pri eraro]"
"(https://bugs.kde.org/408369)) ([Ŝanĝi](https://invent.kde .org/graphics/"
"krita/-/commit/c3279cd2ae), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:72
msgid ""
"General: Add Unify Layers Color Space action. ([Change](https://invent.kde."
"org/graphics/krita/-/commit/e0529a5168), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgstr ""
"Ĝenerala: Aldonu agadon Unuigi Tavolojn Koloro-Spaco. ([Ŝanĝo](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/e0529a5168), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2024/monthly-update-21.md:73
msgid ""
"Layers: Don't allow moving a mask onto a locked layer. ([Change](https://"
