#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-30.md:9
msgid ""
"A new bugfix release, Krita 5.2.13, is out. (5.2.12 was an Android-only "
"release skipped in favor of making a release on all platforms.)"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-30.md:11
msgid ""
"It mainly fixes a crash on Android when Krita is in the background, and "
"makes the Transform Tool respond correctly to touch input, both thanks to "
"our new Android maintainer Carsten Hartenfels."
msgstr ""

