"candidate-is-out/):"

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-30.md:16
msgid ""
"The UI for text properties continues to get polished. There's a new [in-"
"depth post about text language selection and style preset work](https://"
"krita-artists.org/t/text-tool-thread/57973/219), and Wolthera has put out a "
"[call for testing and feedback](https://krita-artists.org/t/text-tool-"
"thread/57973/221) about the way paragraph and character property setting is "
"handled."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-30.md:18
msgid "Wayland Port Progress"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-30.md:19
msgid ""
"After months of work, Dmitry has implemented [initial color management "
"support on Wayland](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2457). This is necessary for artists whose work requires "
"color accuracy such as for printing to be able to view their colors "
"accurately on modern Linux compositors."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-30.md:21
msgid "Google Summer of Code"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-30.md:22
msgid ""
"Krita's Google Summer of Code student for this year, Ross Rosales, "
"successfully completed a project creating a [Selection Actions Bar](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2422). This feature, which "
"can be toggled in settings under General->Tools, give quick access to "
"various ways to interact with a selection: Select All, Invert Selection, "
"Deselect All, Fill Selection with Color, Clear Selection, Copy Selection to "
"New Layer, Crop to Selection."
msgstr ""

