#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-33.md:12
msgid "Text Rework Progress"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-32.md:10
msgid ""
"The Text Tool's Tool Options have been overhauled. There's now a button to "
"access the Text Properties docker, along with an option to create new texts "
"with current properties or with a style preset. Options to switch between "
"using visual or logical cursor direction for bidirectional text, and pasting "
"rich or plain text have also been added. ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2490))"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-32.md:12
msgid ""
"The other addition is Type Setting Mode, which shows transform handles for "
"the font size and baseline-shift. With preformatted or pre-positioned text, "
"character transforms are also possible. Holding Shift shows different "
"baselines to switch to. ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2513))"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-32.md:14
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Text: Implement Convert to Shape for bitmap fonts. ([Change](https://"
#| "invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2261), by Wolthera van "
#| "Hövell)"
msgid ""
"In the area of file formats, basic support has been added for PSD text "
"layers, vector masks, vector strokes, vector parametric shapes, and guides. "
"([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/1954))"
msgstr ""
"Teksto: Efektivigu Konverti al Formo por bitmapaj tiparoj. ([Ŝanĝo](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2261), de Wolthera van Hövell)"

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-32.md:16
msgid ""
"Wolthera [discusses these changes](https://krita-artists.org/t/text-tool-"
"thread/57973/227) in the Text Tool thread and asks again for feedback on a "
"[proposal for splitting character and paragraph properties](https://invent."
"kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2470)."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-32.md:18
msgid "Touch Input Fixes"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-32.md:19
msgid ""
"Carsten has continued to fix issues with touch input in the Stable branch."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-32.md:21
msgid ""
"Long-press handled has been further improved. Long-pressing a slider-spinbox "
"no longer shows text selection handles when not in text edit mode. The long-"
"press distance is now calculated correctly, so a slight movement won't "
"cancel it. The kinetic scrolling timeout no longer adds onto the long-press "
"timeout. ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2503))"
msgstr ""

