#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-33.md:29
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Flexible Comic Paneling"
msgid "New Comic Panel Editing Tool"
msgstr "Fleksebla Komika Panelado"

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-33.md:30
msgid ""
"There's a new tool in the Toolbox: the Comic Panel Editing Tool. Agata "
"designed this for creating comic panel gutters by cutting gaps in vector "
"shapes. ([MR!2331](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2331))"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2025/monthly-update-33.md:32
msgid ""
"It can be set to cut different gap widths depending on whether the cut is "
"horizontal, vertical, or diagonal past a certain angle. A second mode in "
"Tool Options removes the gaps for easy re-adjustment."
msgstr ""

