"The Transform Tool's Liquify mode has had some optimizations done by Agata. "
"It's especially faster on large canvases, because it now avoids calculating "
"outside the affected area. ([MR!4261](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/merge_requests/2461))"
