#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:0
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "First Beta for Krita 5.2.3 Released"
msgid "First beta for Krita 5.3 and Krita 6.0"
msgstr "Unua Beta por Krita 5.2.3 Eldonita"

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:9
msgid ""
"We have started the release process for the next feature release of Krita "
"today! This release is the culmination of years of hard work. From the same "
"codebase, we're building both Krita 5.3, based on Qt5, and Krita 6.0.0. "
"based on Qt6. Krita 6 is not yet available for Android or ChromeOS because "
"Qt6 is unstable on those platforms."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:11
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:13
#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta2-released.md:20
#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta3-released.md:17
msgid ""
"To learn about everything that has changed, check [the release notes]"
"(https://krita.org/en/release-notes/krita-5-3-release-notes/)!"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:15
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Text Object Features"
msgid "Text Object"
msgstr "Tekstaj Objektoj Trajtoj"

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:17
msgid ""
"The text object has been completely rewritten, as have all the tools to "
"handle text. You can now edit text on the canvas, make text wrap inside "
"vector shapes and put text on a vector path. We support most if not all "
"scripts fully as well."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:19
msgid ""
"A variety of technical blog posts were written on the topic: [Fonts](https://"
"wolthera.info/2024/07/making-sense-of-font-selection/), [Open Type](https://"
"wolthera.info/2025/03/controls-for-opentype/), [Font Metrics](https://"
"wolthera.info/2025/04/going-in-depth-on-font-metrics/), [various other "
"properties](https://wolthera.info/2025/09/remainder-of-the-text-"
"properties/), [Text in Shape and Type Setting Mode](https://wolthera."
"info/2025/11/text-tool-phase-3/)."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:21
msgid "Wayland Color Management Support"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:23
msgid ""
"A Krita 6-only feature, on Linux, we now support Wayland color management "
"support when Krita runs in native Wayland mode. Note that the only "
"officially supported wayland compositor is KWin. If you use another "
"compositor and find an issue, test with kwin first whether that issue "
"reproducible."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:25
msgid "Tools"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:27
msgid ""
"There is a completely new tool: a knife tool for vector objects, for merging "
"and splitting vector objects. This is extremely handle when creating comic "
"page layouts. Other tools have been extended or have improved performance. "
"For instance, the freehand drawing tool has a pixel-art stabilizer and the "
"liquify transform tool is much faster."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:29
msgid "Assistants"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:31
msgid ""
"Configuring assistants has become easier and there's a new curve-linear "
"perspective assistant."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:33
msgid "Filters"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:35
msgid ""
"There are new filters: propagate colors and color overlay mask. All blending "
"modes have been checked for correctness when working in HDR."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:37
msgid "Dockers"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:39
msgid ""
"The recorder docker now can capture in real time. Dockers can be added to "
"the popup palette."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:41
msgid "Brush Engines"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:43
msgid ""
"Among other improvements, the pattern option has been extended with a soft "
"texturing mode."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:45
msgid "File Formats"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:47
msgid ""
"There is support for a new file format, Radiance RGBE. Additionally, JPEG-XL "
"support has been improved a lot, just in time for Googles volte-face on JPEG-"
"XL support. And... Text objects in PhotoShop files now be loaded as text! "
"You can save text to PSD as well, but only in a limited way."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:49
msgid "Python Plugin API"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/krita-6.0.0-beta1-released.md:51
msgid ""
"The Python plugin API has been extended with an API for generating brush "
"strokes, new user interface objects and new methods for existing classes. "
"There are also new python plugins."
msgstr ""

