#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2601.md:10
msgid ""
"Luna fixed two crashes in the Stable branch; when undoing the Transform Tool "
"during another transformation ([bug](https://bugs.kde.org/498696); [change]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2565)), and when an "
"embedded color profile is invalid. ([bug](https://bugs.kde.org/509875); "
"[change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2538))."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2601.md:12
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "File Formats: EXR: Possibly fix saving EXR files with extremely low alpha "
#| "values. ([Change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
#| "commit/9d5e921077), by Dmitry Kazakov)"
msgid ""
"Dmitry fixed loading TIFF files with JPEG compression ([change](https://"
"invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/commit/2e27356a7a))."
msgstr ""
"Dosieraj Formatoj: EXR: Eble ripari la konservadon de EXR-dosieroj kun "
"ekstreme malaltaj alfa-valoroj. ([Ŝanĝo](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/"
"krita/-/commit/9d5e921077), de Dmitry Kazakov)"

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2601.md:14
msgid "In the Unstable branch, a handful more bugfixes were made:"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2601.md:16
msgid ""
"Wolthera fixed parsing white-space-only text elements ([bug](https://bugs."
"kde.org/513085); [change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2562)), and issues setting text color ([bug](https://bugs.kde."
"org/513207); [change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2571))."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2601.md:18
msgid ""
"Carsten worked around multitouch gestures being cancelled on Xiaomi Pad "
"devices ([bug](https://bugs.kde.org/510993); [change](https://invent.kde.org/"
"graphics/krita/-/merge_requests/2582)), and combined simultaneous canvas "
"rotation and zoom messages ([change](https://invent.kde.org/graphics/krita/-/"
"merge_requests/2583))."
msgstr ""

