#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:31
msgid ""
"Zoom In/Out to Cursor is the default canvas input zoom again, and Zoom In/"
"Out to Center is the alternatively configurable action. ([bug]({{<bug-url "
"515554>}}); [change]({{<merge-request-url 2645>}}) by Carsten)"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:33
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Fixes"
