#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:35
msgid ""
"Some Krita 6 bugs were caused using an outdated version of Qt6. As updating "
"Qt would cause too many issues before the final release, Dmitry backported "
"the fixes to our version."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:37
msgid ""
"On Windows, Krita won't crash when news is enabled ([bug]({{<bug-url "
"515619>}}); [change](https://invent.kde.org/dkazakov/qtbase/-/commit/"
"a245521d84)) and menus won't instantly close when using a stylus with WinTab "
"([bug 1]({{<bug-url 515639>}}), [bug 2]({{<bug-url 515614>}}); [change]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/dkazakov/qtbase/-/commit/197aeee138))."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:39
msgid ""
"On Linux with Wayland, issues with incorrect stylus cursor position ([bug 1]"
"({{<bug-url 515618>}}), [bug 2]({{<bug-url 504546>}}); [change 1](https://"
"invent.kde.org/dkazakov/qtbase/-/commit/37ffe5037d), [change 2](https://"
"invent.kde.org/dkazakov/qtwayland/-/commit/4dc42ccfd9)), wrong cursor shape "
"([change](https://invent.kde.org/dkazakov/qtwayland/-/commit/17c74fea67)), "
"and shortcut keys being auto-repeated ([bug]({{<bug-url 506141>}}); [change]"
"(https://invent.kde.org/dkazakov/qtwayland/-/commit/08f16cfc7c)) are fixed."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:41
msgid ""
"The Help menu's Report Bug item is back, so don't be shy to report bugs! "
"([bug]({{<bug-url 515803>}}); [change]({{<merge-request-url 2644>}}) by Luna)"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:43
msgid "Fixes in Beta 3"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:45
msgid ""
"File Layers now allow Inherit Alpha and Layer Styles ([change]({{<commit-url "
"d9436e3e13>}})), .kra files used as File Layers now use their color profiles "
"([bug]({{<bug-url 467608>}}); [change]({{<merge-request-url 2669>}})), and "
"renaming File, Filter, and Generator Layers is now undoable ([bug]({{<bug-"
"url 506233>}}); [change]({{<commit-url 72af5096bb>}})), all thanks to Dmitry."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:47
msgid ""
"Agata fixed some regressions. Tools that auto-scroll when dragged to the "
"edge of the canvas, such as the Selection tools, no longer scroll too much "
"when zoomed in ([bug]({{<bug-url 514871>}}) [change]({{<merge-request-url "
"2632>}})); Liquify Transform Masks no longer appear different than before "
"([bug]({{<bug-url 512577>}}); [change]({{<merge-request-url 2664>}})), plus "
"the new Comics Panel Editing Tool no longer affects text (rather than "
"turning characters into blocks) ([bug]({{<bug-url 515963>}}); [change]"
"({{<merge-request-url 2650>}}))"
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:49
msgid ""
"On Android, a saving issue where the file is claimed to be unwritable was "
"fixed by Carsten ([change]({{<merge-request-url 2667>}}))."
msgstr ""

#: content/en/posts/2026/monthly-report-2603.md:51
msgid ""
"On Linux with X11/XWayland, there have been [reports]({{<bug-url 516267>}}) "
"of Krita 6 running at a low framerate. The [fix]({{<commit-url "
"bd6975bd38>}}) for this is to [switch](https://invent.kde.org/dkazakov/"
"qtbase/-/commit/ac3a7162ac) the OpenGL interface from GLX to EGL. This "
"switch needs testing, so please read the [EGL backend testing thread]"
"(https://krita-artists.org/t/needs-testing-new-egl-backend-for-gpu-"
"acceleration-on-linux-with-x11-xwayland/170414) on how to do that and leave "
"some feedback on whether it works or not."
msgstr ""

